{"unit_id":"LiuMengxuan04__oh-my-dsh#card-zh","repo":"LiuMengxuan04/oh-my-dsh","commit":"fa770d7ab2a5a393952d7e11ed59d016e7ccaa55","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Oh My DSH（DSH 插件，CLI 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 中持续较久的开发工作提供有边界、可恢复的自主编排。它将持久化 Autopilot 服务、工具、命令和任务工作流接入 DSH，把目标整理为带依赖、尝试记录和证据的 DAG，并通过固定检查与审阅流程决定完成状态。主要功能包括暂停和恢复长任务、派发持续子代理、按顺序执行文件任务队列、保存项目记忆与交接记录，以及查看运行仪表板。适合需要跨多个模型轮次推进、委派并核验开发工作的 DSH 用户。安装后可用 `/autopilot` 与 `/mission` 控制；通知和 MCP 等附加集成按配置启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1","src/commands.ts:574","src/tools.ts:1268","src/mission-service.ts:161","src/tool-memory.ts:203"]}
{"unit_id":"LiuMengxuan04__oh-my-dsh#card-en","repo":"LiuMengxuan04/oh-my-dsh","commit":"fa770d7ab2a5a393952d7e11ed59d016e7ccaa55","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Oh My DSH is a DSH CLI plugin for long development tasks. It adds persistent Autopilot runs with task graphs, evidence, checks, and recovery. Users can pause or resume, delegate to subagents, run file missions, keep project memory, and view a dashboard. Control runs with `/autopilot` and `/mission`.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1","src/commands.ts:574","src/tools.ts:1268","src/mission-service.ts:161","src/tool-memory.ts:203"]}
